<article class="env-lemma" id="02NK">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02NK">Lemma <span data-tag="02NK">29.30.2</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes which is locally of finite type. If $f$ has relative dimension $d$, then so does any base change of $f$. Same for relative dimension $\leq d$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
